Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:42:38 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] Add a verified "Delete from recorder" for imported Plaud
 recordings

Deletes one recording from the Note Pro only after the vault copy checks out:
imported from this recorder and session, still active, playable file present,
and the kept device original matches the recorder's size and the SHA-256
recorded at import. Lists again afterwards to confirm it is gone. The API
route accepts requests from this computer only.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
